Z||000001||Hank is Here||01-29-2001||09:41 AM||||Doesn't sound that bad.  It will probaby be time to switch to 134A as well when you finally fix the compressor.  It is winter so I know around here I have no reason to use A/C now, but in Flordia who knows when you need to use it.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Shiner||01-29-2001||03:01 PM||||My GT has no belt on the AC compressor.  It doesn't seem to make a difference at all.||||reg||1
Z||000003||fiero56||01-29-2001||03:31 PM||||It will be fine. The compressor will probably seize if it sits real long, but shouldn't matter since it's bad anyway. The only adverse affect you will notice is the defrost won't be as effective.||||reg||1
